    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24057" root="صدى" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدٍ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَادٍ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدْيَانُ</span></b>  (S, M, Msb, K)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدًى</span></b>  [which last is an inf. n. used as an
epithet] (M) <i>Thirsting:</i> (S, M, Msb, K:) or
<i>thirsting vehemently:</i> (M:) fem. [of the first]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدِيَةٌ</span> (Msb) and [of the second] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَادِيَةٌ</span> (Msb, K)
and [of the third] ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدْيَا</span></b> : (S, M, Msb, K:) and
the pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَادِيَةٌ</span> is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَوَادٍ</span>. (Ham p. 329.)

